#: ../../source/module/index.rst:2 5bf626a0940842b3aa060c0d97373867
msgid "功能指南"
msgstr "Feature Guide"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:4 a0379729fe8041498b46cba83f4b6bb4
msgid "这里按 NepTrainKit 左侧页面顺序回答“我正在这个页面，具体该查哪一项”。首页负责选择 大方向；本页直接给出每个页面最常用的子入口。"
msgstr ""
"This section follows the order of NepTrainKit's left-hand pages and "
"answers a practical question: “I am on this page—what should I look up?” "
"The home page helps you choose a broad direction; this page links "
"directly to the most useful subpages for each screen."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:8 1241f280409e485698ed25c6caa007c4
#
msgid "NEP 数据集查看（NEP Dataset Display）"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:10 396496de92c04036b9d3eca16768726f
msgid "用于打开结构和训练输出、查看散点图、定位结构、清洗数据和导出子集。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to open structures and training outputs, inspect scatter plots, "
"locate structures, clean data, and export subsets."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:12 b186c29f05cc4cdc8087742c9b75896e
msgid "不会打开结构、``nep.txt`` 或训练输出：:doc:`nep-display-open-data`"
msgstr ""
"Cannot open structures, ``nep.txt``, or training outputs: :doc:`nep-"
"display-open-data`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:13 dc007e2d41ff417799fc5f21370dd8aa
msgid "不认识图上工具或不清楚 x/y 含义：:doc:`nep-display-main-plot-tools`"
msgstr ""
"Do not recognize a plot tool or are unsure what x/y mean: :doc:`nep-"
"display-main-plot-tools`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:14 97926ce0f28b44c285261800255a9ac8
msgid "想按标签、元素或表达式筛选：:doc:`nep-display-filter`"
msgstr ""
"Want to filter by labels, elements, or expressions: :doc:`nep-display-"
"filter`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:15 af9d3451d9e84c60891107a23bd983ee
msgid "想标记、删除、恢复或导出结构：:doc:`nep-display-structure-tools`"
msgstr ""
"Want to tag, delete, restore, or export structures: :doc:`nep-display-"
"structure-tools`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:16 71f35dd4983449b3a6565ba722fdc651
msgid "页面没图、数量不对或工具不可用：:doc:`nep-display-status-and-errors`"
msgstr ""
"The page has no plot, the count is wrong, or a tool is unavailable: :doc"
":`nep-display-status-and-errors`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:17 e032eb9fa8b34e84a222a79ecbff6a16
msgid "先看完整页面逻辑：:doc:`NEP-dataset-display`"
msgstr "Start with the complete page logic: :doc:`NEP-dataset-display`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:20 fbe6987284914b3da320dc8bfa2a382e
msgid "训练集评估（Training Set Audit）"
msgstr "Training Set Audit"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:22 b4e883f2668c47659686dc56b7fec411
msgid "用于检查当前训练数据快照的标签质量、组成、结构相、磁类型和需要人工复核的问题。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to inspect label quality, composition, structural phases, magnetic"
" types, and issues that require manual review in the current training-"
"data snapshot."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:24 7d3efbfa8112473382ce1804e9ced56c
msgid "第一次进入，先处理阻塞项：:doc:`training-audit-overview`"
msgstr ""
"On your first visit, handle blocking issues first: :doc:`training-audit-"
"overview`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:25 da21dcec280a4167a40a6af1a2f94381
msgid "查看组分、标签范围和数据分布：:doc:`training-audit-data-map`"
msgstr ""
"Inspect composition, label ranges, and data distributions: :doc"
":`training-audit-data-map`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:26 8151094c35984ec991e7e534d490f0fd
msgid "检查局域环境证据：:doc:`training-audit-advanced`"
msgstr "Inspect local-environment evidence: :doc:`training-audit-advanced`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:27 1e573257583c4c6ca377cf75dadfe365
msgid "核对结构相或磁类型判据：:doc:`training-audit-phase` / :doc:`training-audit-magnetism`"
msgstr ""
"Check phase or magnetic-type criteria: :doc:`training-audit-phase` / :doc"
":`training-audit-magnetism`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:29 5846d3c4cfee43ac8f2f7a2b5d1f7ba8
msgid ""
"记录人工判断并导出结果：:doc:`training-audit-review-queue` / :doc:`training-audit-"
"report`"
msgstr ""
"Record manual decisions and export results: :doc:`training-audit-review-"
"queue` / :doc:`training-audit-report`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:31 3ab6c7082a10461ebbbeebc0850acb65
msgid "先理解整页阅读顺序：:doc:`training-set-assessment`"
msgstr ""
"Understand the reading order of the full page first: :doc:`training-set-"
"assessment`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:34 36073e3c07314f76bf3628e35895cdb3
msgid "构建数据集（Make Dataset）"
msgstr "Make Dataset"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:36 e5193f11102641b499879f020f0d41b4
msgid "用于从基础结构生成应变、扰动、合金、缺陷、表面、分子或磁性候选构型。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to generate strained, perturbed, alloy, defect, surface, "
"molecular, or magnetic candidate configurations from base structures."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:38 df010993ba5a4b6bb61edb44b262e006
msgid "不认识顶部按钮和卡片运行顺序：:doc:`make-dataset`"
msgstr ""
"Do not recognize the top buttons or card execution order: :doc:`make-"
"dataset`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:39 a5e5332b9b7745bcb66329a149c1ea7c
msgid "不知道该选哪张卡：:doc:`make-dataset-cards/index`"
msgstr "Do not know which card to choose: :doc:`make-dataset-cards/index`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:40 160f9a8af7c04e5794051cc081a95279
msgid "已经选定卡片，要查参数和原理：从 :doc:`make-dataset-cards/index` 进入对应分类和具体卡片"
msgstr ""
"Have chosen a card and need its parameters and principles: start at :doc"
":`make-dataset-cards/index`, then open the relevant category and card"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:42 519c56f3c9644eb59e40df6154595630
msgid "想直接参考完整多卡流程：:doc:`make-dataset-cards/recipes`"
msgstr "Want a complete multi-card workflow: :doc:`make-dataset-cards/recipes`"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:45 21965fd7d93140cebe59ce28940c54ee
msgid "数据管理（Data Management）"
msgstr "Data Management (Data Management)"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:47 f0544b728af74447b6bc94f773347795
msgid ""
"用于记录项目、模型、数据和输出路径之间的关系。先看 :doc:`data-management` "
"中的推荐记录方式、常用操作和存储位置。它不替代结构文件本身， 也不会自动判断哪一版模型更可靠。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to record relationships between projects, models, data, and output"
" paths. Start with the recommended record format, common operations, and "
"storage locations in :doc:`data-management`. It does not replace the "
"structure files themselves or decide automatically which model version is"
" more reliable."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:52 d56a5c64ddb94f449fc3cc9d0ee43594
msgid "设置（Settings）"
msgstr "Settings"

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:54 5fe2fab5a6ec4bf8a74ff251b8b269f7
msgid ""
"用于调整 NEP 后端、绘图、结构显示、NEP89 和更新行为。进入 :doc:`settings` 后， "
"先确认设置影响的是计算、显示还是更新；遇到 CUDA 不可用时先看“NEP 后端”，不要只反复切换 下拉框。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to adjust the NEP backend, plotting, structure display, NEP89, and"
" update behavior. After opening :doc:`settings`, first determine whether "
"a setting affects computation, display, or updates. If CUDA is "
"unavailable, read the “NEP backend” section instead of repeatedly "
"switching the drop-down."

#: ../../source/module/index.rst:58 bf4b8cc45ff442d0a8285cfe66ede234
msgid ""
"还不知道从哪里开始时，看 :doc:`../quickstart`；已经有候选结构准备送 DFT 时，看 :doc:`../workflows"
"/clean-candidate-structures`。术语不清楚或遇到报错时，直接进入 "
":doc:`../reference/glossary` 或 :doc:`../reference/troubleshooting`。"
msgstr ""
"If you still do not know where to start, see :doc:`../quickstart`. If you"
" already have candidate structures ready for DFT, see :doc:`../workflows"
"/clean-candidate-structures`. If a term is unclear or an error occurs, go"
" directly to :doc:`../reference/glossary` or "
":doc:`../reference/troubleshooting`."

